u to create your own Legendary Tales.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/a34800c4db5f5d5658c74e289721eafe.webp?t=1710443135\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/84f8886b3740b8a8b3d9361cf9b04cb3.webp?t=1710443135\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/9f0be04d8f640150a9c5f4e6f57a5d2b.poster.avif?t=1710443135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/9f0be04d8f640150a9c5f4e6f57a5d2b.webm?t=1710443135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/9f0be04d8f640150a9c5f4e6f57a5d2b.mp4?t=1710443135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Built from the ground up for VR; Legendary Tales will throw you into an immersive fantasy world, suitable for any PCVR platform with customisable graphics settings to ensure you get the smoothest possible experience.</ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/185c010f45c2c52ed2e49b18f9220886.webp?t=1710443135\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/f3f88e97adf423cb6eb8cbea2f1b2ddb.poster.avif?t=1710443135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/f3f88e97adf423cb6eb8cbea2f1b2ddb.webm?t=1710443135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/f3f88e97adf423cb6eb8cbea2f1b2ddb.mp4?t=1710443135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Up to 4 players can play Legendary Tales in co-op mode. Grab some friends, trade some items, and head down into the dungeon to fight your way through the darkness together.</ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/bd3ce52ceea9e24f22bd916e581e0ca3.webp?t=1710443135\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">The physics in Legendary Tales was built to mimic the way real weapons feel and act as close as possible while still being fun to play. Weapons have their own weight so that larger swings will do more damage. Not only that but enemies and destructible items also react to how hard you hit them for a truly engaging experience. </ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/b3d72756b5a00112ca5c83baf1d9cf5d.webp?t=1710443135\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/e3fb37d4c870356ce6305449a6710cd3.poster.avif?t=1710443135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/e3fb37d4c870356ce6305449a6710cd3.webm?t=1710443135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/e3fb37d4c870356ce6305449a6710cd3.mp4?t=1710443135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Want to try sneaky kills with a dagger? Hit your enemies from afar with a bow? Or just mash some faces with a morning star? There are a host of different weapon types to suit your play style so find what works for you! And for every weapon type you will find so many variations on their stats thanks to random number generated items. The items are classed into five categories ranging from normal to Legendary. which not only look awesome but have special abilities. What abilities? You\u2019ll have to get one for yourself to find out.</ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/2d1be4b5f84a3dc6cf541986ee9b0265.webp?t=1710443135\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">As you fight your way through the world, your character will grow based on how you play. But there\u2019s more to growth than just how you fight, work your way through the magic and skills available to truly bring your character to the next level.</ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/41e0da0c9c8c13492f80194e941d0c90.webp?t=1710443135\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Weapons are fun and all but through the skill tree you can improve your abilities with combat skills or find yourself a Legendary item with their own special abilities and even more, you can upgrade their skills! </ul> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/fe9ecadf4dccf349ee08b1f2ad9b1bdc.webp?t=1710443135\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/b5497c357bca14e46249dcab3ebaeb7e.poster.avif?t=1710443135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/b5497c357bca14e46249dcab3ebaeb7e.webm?t=1710443135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/b5497c357bca14e46249dcab3ebaeb7e.mp4?t=1710443135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>If hunting for weapons in the dungeons isn\u2019t for you then we have good news! You can create your own weapons with ingredients found on your adventures, or by honing the weapons you\u2019ve collected. You can also make potions to prepare deep dungeon crawling and disassemble items you found during your adventures to get ingredients and enhance your crafted weapons or potions with them.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/447672a2c62eaeed9c5dd5d63a7aa40c.poster.avif?t=1710443135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/447672a2c62eaeed9c5dd5d63a7aa40c.webm?t=1710443135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465070/extras/447672a2c62eaeed9c5dd5d63a7aa40c.mp4?t=1710443135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Get ready for an epic adventure in VR! Put on your headset, find some friends and head into the dungeon to start creating your own Legendary Tales.",
